@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title UC-FM03 — family live service progress (implemented)
start
:Open View progress from FM02\nor /family/visits/:visitId;
if (Valid positive Long visit ID?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Show invalid-link feedback; stop reads;
  stop
endif
repeat
  if (Visible and online?) then (yes)
  else (no)
    :Cancel requests and timer;\nshow paused / stale data;
    :Wait until visible and online;
  endif
  :Check current FAMILY session;
  if (Current FAMILY session confirmed?) then (yes)
    :Clear prior account data if identity changed;
    :Read details, timeline and tasks independently;
  note right
    Every GET authorizes the visit's actual elder
    using the current binding and records audit.
    APPLIED history only; DONE-only task count.
    No care writes or inferred state transitions.
  end note
  else (no)
    :Handle session failure; do not read sections;
  endif
  if (Any 400 / 401 / 403 / 404?) then (yes)
    :Cancel remaining reads; clear protected data;\nstop automatic refresh;
    :Show login / access / missing / invalid feedback;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Update successful sections and their times;
    if (Any retryable failure?) then (yes)
      :Keep same-account prior section in memory\nwith its original time and stale warning;
      :Retry after 30s, then 60s maximum;
    else (no)
      :Next round 15s after this round finishes;
    endif
  endif
  :Wait; manual refresh may start earlier;\nhidden/offline cancels requests and timer;
repeat while (Still on this visit page?) is (yes) not (no)
:Cancel requests/timer; remove listeners;
stop
legend bottom
After terminal feedback, explicit login/retry re-enters the flow and reauthorizes.
Visibility/network events cannot resume a terminally stopped flow.
Late results from cancelled rounds cannot change the current page.
CG03/CG05 writes and real upstream integration are pending.
endlegend
@enduml
